; PLACEHOLDER: primitives with the street's procedural textures and CC0
; stand-in models (docs/RIGHTS_REGISTER.md). Replaced by the painted
; stylized 3D of GDD §10. Palette: GDD §10 Grove row, rose-gold dusk,
; without peacock blue or magenta (CLAUDE.md).

